      "text": "The audit identified gaps later fixed via shipped PRs, including a paste escape-injection bug, missing DECSTR/REP/IRM/DECOM handlers, DCS misrouting into the Sixel decoder, and Kitty graphics being display-only; animation (a=a) and iTerm2 multipart upload remain deliberately deferred."
